# Loop: DWFM congestive collapse after DynamoDB returned (02:25 PDT). Mechanism as described by AWS; dynamics illustrative.
...@_style
(** -> **)[*].style: {stroke: "#5B7CBA"; font-color: "#8A9EC0"; stroke-width: 2}
direction: down
queue: "queue of lease work" {class: warn}
attempt: "attempt lease" {class: svc}
timeout: "lease work timed out\n(took longer than the timeout)" {class: bad}
requeue: "requeue" {class: warn}
queue -> attempt
attempt -> timeout: "too many droplets"
timeout -> requeue
requeue -> queue: "more work queued"
launch: "new launch request" {class: svc}
api: "EC2 API" {class: svc}
launch -> api
api -> launch: "insufficient capacity\n(droplets without a lease aren't launch candidates)" {style.stroke: "#FF4C6E"}
fix: "04:14 throttle intake + selective DWFM restarts → queues cleared → 05:28 all leases" {class: ok}
